// (`monde:croix_bordes`), a wagon of the Guild. Then Roquebise on its wedding morning: the fountain, the street of the
// potters and its third house, the glassworks closed for a commission, and a wedding cup that broke at dawn
// (`monde:coupe_noce`). The morning ends at the hour-stone of the nineteenth league (M05).
